      "a": "(i)\nGiven AP is $$3,1,-1,-3,...$$\nFirst term: $$a=3$$\nCommon difference:\n$$d=1-3$$\n$$\\therefore d=-2$$\n(ii). $$-5,-1,3,7,...$$\nAns: (ii)\nGiven AP is $$-5,-1,3,7,...$$\nFirst term: $$a=-5$$\nCommon difference:\n$$d=-1-\\left( -5 \\right)$$\n$$\\therefore d=4$$\n(iii). $$\\dfrac{1}{3},\\dfrac{5}{3},\\dfrac{9}{3},\\dfrac{13}{3}...$$\nAns: (iii)\nGiven AP is $$\\dfrac{1}{3},\\dfrac{5}{3},\\dfrac{9}{3},\\dfrac{13}{3}...$$\nFirst term: $$a=\\dfrac{1}{3}$$\nCommon difference:\n$$d=\\dfrac{5}{3}-\\dfrac{1}{3}$$\n$$\\therefore d=\\dfrac{4}{3}$$\n(iv). $$0.6,1.7,2.8,3.9,...$$\nAns: (iv)\nGiven AP is $$0.6,1.7,2.8,3.9,...$$\nFirst term: $$a=0.6$$\nCommon difference:\n$$d=1.7-0.6$$\n$$\\therefore d=1.1$$"
