      "q": "14. If $${{S}_{1}},{{S}_{2}},{{S}_{3}}$$ be the sum of $$n,2n,3n$$ terms respectively of an AP, prove that\u00a0$${{S}_{3}}=3({{S}_{2}}-{{S}_{1}})$$\n.",
