      "q": "1. There are $\\text{3}$ villages A, B and C such that the distance from A to B is $7$km, from B to C is $5$ km and from C to A is $8$ km. The gram pradhan wants to dig a well in such a way that the distance from each village is equal. What should be the location of well? Which value is depicted by gram pradhan?",
