      "q": "15. A solid metallic circular cone $20cm$ height with a vertical angle of $60$ is cut into two parts at the middle point of its height by a plane parallel to the base. If the frustum, so obtained be drawn into a wire of diameter $\\dfrac{1}{16}$ cm. Find the length of the wire.",
