      "q": "2. A tent is in the shape of a cylinder surmounted by a conical top. If the height and diameter of the cylindrical part are $2.1$ m and $4$ m respectively and the slant height of the top is $2.8$ m, find the area of the canvas used for making the tent. Also, find the cost of the canvas of the tent at the rate of Rs. $500\\text{ }per\\text{ }{{m}^{2}}$ . (Note that the base of the tent will not be covered with canvas.)",
